The canonical repository policy is in `AGENTS.md`. Follow it first.

Cursor-specific guidance for Relay:

- Use this rule only as a supplement to `AGENTS.md`, not as a competing policy source.
- Cursor has no official Relay-managed hook flow here, so call `checkpoint_context` before compaction-equivalent actions, before switching threads, and after a meaningful unit of work when durable continuity matters.
- Keep searches and file reads tight. Do not repeatedly scan the repo for the same symbol.
